{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["A man who gives to the priest — that he donate something fitting for priests, such as devoted items (חרמים), and so forth." "To him it shall be — that is: he gives it to the priest." "And the derash of the Aggadah: איש אשר יתן לכהן — what he is obligated to give him. יהיה — to him: much wealth. And since it is superfluous, they expounded it thus."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:11.899138019Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}